## The typed relation graph

Open [graph.html](graph.html) to browse it: records cluster by domain, selecting one
renders it beside the graph, and a link inside a record navigates to it. The page is
self-contained, so it opens from the filesystem with no server.

Every edge below is derived from the record it appears in, so this view cannot
drift from the records the way the hand-maintained table it replaced did. The
same edge set is [graph.md](graph.md) and, as raw data, [graph.json](graph.json).

